  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [autoprefixer](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer) from `v7.2.1` to `v7.2.3`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>postcss/autoprefixer</summary>\n\n#### 7.2.3\n-   [`7af5965`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/7af5965d3a17fece4a73544ae15bb13276b24bd5) Release 7.2.3 version\n-   [`361ca8c`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/361ca8cb3c1921554cc598d9080acd9dbd5b5517) Update dependencies\n-   [`0550db0`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/0550db0a9a4d024c78ac16fe80f2a80f789975cf) Fix test\n-   [`c762f4b`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/c762f4bbc1a86aadd5dd0bbb18571976493f91dc)  Fix #&#8203;954  (#&#8203;955)\n#### 7.2.2\n-   [`c8a69e2`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/c8a69e2669178c38aa255bc6d792c6bcf5e46444) Release 7.2.2 version\n-   [`fe8ec43`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/fe8ec43906667f1eba201e73e36c11106e691820) Fix Size Limit warning\n-   [`93e12e8`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/93e12e87f04c25232cda6fa4e01a157c0016dc6e) Update dependencies\n-   [`0072163`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/00721633f4900c9c2d2e006a4dd3d29828e8993f) Fix strange issue by stacktrace\n-   [`462f05c`](https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer/commit/462f05c2b861df5d03077782c54c7f532beb619c) Reduce size &amp; make animation check a little faster (#&#8203;949)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
